source_text:
A manufacturing firm seeks to optimize its production schedule over a \(T\)-day planning horizon to meet daily demand while minimizing costs. The firm starts with an initial inventory of \(s_0\) units. Production can be carried out during regular time and via overtime. The costs are as follows:
\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Regular production cost:} \(c^{prod}_t\) dollars per unit on day \(t\).
    \item \textbf{Overtime production cost:} \(c^{over}_{t}\) dollars per unit on day \(t\).
    \item \textbf{Inventory cost:} \(c^{inv}\) dollars per unit carried over from one day to the next.
\end{itemize}

target_text:
Sebuah perusahaan manufaktur ingin mengoptimalkan jadwal produksinya selama cakrawala perencanaan \(T\) hari untuk memenuhi permintaan harian sekaligus meminimalkan biaya. Perusahaan memulai dengan persediaan awal sebanyak \(s_0\) unit. Produksi dapat dilakukan pada waktu kerja reguler maupun melalui lembur. Biaya-biayanya adalah sebagai berikut:
\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Biaya produksi reguler:} \(c^{prod}_t\) dolar per unit pada hari \(t\).
    \item \textbf{Biaya produksi lembur:} \(c^{over}_{t}\) dolar per unit pada hari \(t\).
    \item \textbf{Biaya persediaan:} \(c^{inv}\) dolar per unit yang dibawa dari satu hari ke hari berikutnya.
\end{itemize}

source_text:
\modelhead{Sets}
\begin{itemize}
    \item Days of production \( = \{1, 2, \dots, T\}\).
\end{itemize}

target_text:
\modelhead{Himpunan}
\begin{itemize}
    \item Hari produksi \( = \{1, 2, \dots, T\}\).
\end{itemize}

source_text:
\modelhead{Parameters}
\begin{itemize}
    \item \(c^{prod}_t\): Regular production cost per unit on day \(t\) (for \(t=1,\dots,T\)).
    \item \(c^{over}_{t}\): Overtime production cost per unit on day \(t\) (for \(t=1,\dots,T\)).
    \item \(c^{inv}\): Inventory holding cost per unit carried to the next day.
    \item \(d_t\): Demand on day \(t\).
    \item \(s_0\): Initial inventory at the start of day 1.
\end{itemize}

target_text:
\modelhead{Parameter}
\begin{itemize}
    \item \(c^{prod}_t\): Biaya produksi reguler per unit pada hari \(t\) (untuk \(t=1,\dots,T\)).
    \item \(c^{over}_{t}\): Biaya produksi lembur per unit pada hari \(t\) (untuk \(t=1,\dots,T\)).
    \item \(c^{inv}\): Biaya penyimpanan persediaan per unit yang dibawa ke hari berikutnya.
    \item \(d_t\): Permintaan pada hari \(t\).
    \item \(s_0\): Persediaan awal pada awal hari 1.
\end{itemize}

source_text:
\modelhead{Variables}
\begin{itemize}
    \item \(x_t\): Number of units produced in regular time on day \(t\).
    \item \(y_t\): Number of units produced in overtime on day \(t\).
    \item \(s_t\): Inventory at the end of day \(t\).
\end{itemize}

target_text:
\modelhead{Variabel}
\begin{itemize}
    \item \(x_t\): Jumlah unit yang diproduksi pada waktu reguler pada hari \(t\).
    \item \(y_t\): Jumlah unit yang diproduksi pada waktu lembur pada hari \(t\).
    \item \(s_t\): Persediaan pada akhir hari \(t\).
\end{itemize}

source_text:
\modelhead{Model}
\begin{align*}
\min \quad & \sum_{t=1}^{T} \Big( c^{prod}_t x_t + c^{over}_{t} y_t + c^{inv} s_t \Big)   \tag{Total cost} \\
\st        & s_0 + x_1 + y_1 = d_1 + s_1   \tag{Day 1 balance} \\
             & s_{t-1} + x_t + y_t = d_t + s_t &&\quad \text{for all } t = 2,\dots,T   \tag{Inventory balance} \\
             & x_t,\, y_t,\, s_t \ge 0 &&\quad \text{for all } t = 1,\dots,T.
\end{align*}

target_text:
\modelhead{Model}
\begin{align*}
\min \quad & \sum_{t=1}^{T} \Big( c^{prod}_t x_t + c^{over}_{t} y_t + c^{inv} s_t \Big)   \tag{Biaya total} \\
\st        & s_0 + x_1 + y_1 = d_1 + s_1   \tag{Keseimbangan hari 1} \\
             & s_{t-1} + x_t + y_t = d_t + s_t &&\quad \text{untuk semua } t = 2,\dots,T   \tag{Keseimbangan persediaan} \\
             & x_t,\, y_t,\, s_t \ge 0 &&\quad \text{untuk semua } t = 1,\dots,T.
\end{align*}

