  \item Setting the new nonbasic variables \(\,s_1=0\) and \(\,s_3=0\) gives
  \[
  x=4, \quad y=5,\quad s_2=3,\quad z=23.
  \]
  \item Thus our new BFS is 
  \(\bigl(x,y,s_1,s_2,s_3\bigr)=\bigl(4,\,5,\,0,\,3,\,0\bigr)\) 
  with objective value \(z=23\).
\end{itemize}
\end{tcolorbox}

