We dive a little deeper into what the ratio test is here:
\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{The Ratio Test (Formal Definition)}

target_text:
Di sini kita mendalami sedikit lagi apa yang dimaksud dengan uji rasio:
\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Uji Rasio (Definisi Formal)}

source_text:
\textbf{Special Cases:}
    \begin{itemize}
        \item If all \( a_{i,e} \leq 0 \), then the problem is \emph{unbounded}, meaning the objective function can be increased indefinitely.
        \item If multiple rows attain the same minimum ratio, a \emph{tie-breaking rule} is needed (e.g., Bland’s Rule to avoid cycling).
    \end{itemize}

target_text:
\textbf{Kasus Khusus:}
    \begin{itemize}
        \item Jika semua \( a_{i,e} \leq 0 \), maka masalah \emph{tak terbatas}, yang berarti fungsi objektif dapat ditingkatkan tanpa batas.
        \item Jika beberapa baris mencapai rasio minimum yang sama, diperlukan \emph{aturan pemecah hasil imbang} (misalnya, Aturan Bland untuk menghindari siklus).
    \end{itemize}

source_text:
\noindent\textbf{Iteration 1.}
\begin{steppanel}{algenter}
\slab{algenter}{43}{Entering} Both \(x\) and \(y\) have positive coefficients in \(z = 2x + 3y\). By steepest ascent we increase the one with the larger coefficient, \(y\) (coefficient \(3\)), so \(y\) \textbf{enters}.
\end{steppanel}
\begin{steppanel}{algleave}
\slab{algleave}{47}{Ratio test} As \(y\) increases (with \(x=0\)), each basic variable stays nonnegative only up to its ratio:
\[
\begin{aligned}
s_1 = 9 - y   &\ge 0 \iff y \le 9/1  = 9,\\
s_2 = 16 - y  &\ge 0 \iff y \le 16/1 = 16,\\
s_3 = 14 - 2y &\ge 0 \iff y \le 14/2 = 7 \quad(\text{smallest}).
\end{aligned}
\]
The smallest ratio is \(7\), attained by \(s_3\), so \(s_3\) \textbf{leaves}.
\end{steppanel}
\begin{steppanel}{algpivot}
\slab{algpivot}{114}{Pivot} Solve the \(s_3\) row for \(y\): \(y = 7 - 0.5x - 0.5s_3\). Substituting into the objective and the other rows gives
\[
\begin{aligned}
\max\quad & z = 21 + 0.5x - 1.5s_3 \\
\st\quad  & s_1 = 2 - 0.5x + 0.5s_3 \\
          & s_2 = 9 - 1.5x + 0.5s_3 \\
          & y = 7 - 0.5x - 0.5s_3
\end{aligned}
\]
\end{steppanel}

target_text:
\noindent\textbf{Iterasi 1.}
\begin{steppanel}{algenter}
\slab{algenter}{43}{Masuk} Baik \(x\) maupun \(y\) memiliki koefisien positif dalam \(z = 2x + 3y\). Berdasarkan pendakian tercuram, kita meningkatkan variabel dengan koefisien lebih besar, yaitu \(y\) (koefisien \(3\)), sehingga \(y\) \textbf{masuk}.
\end{steppanel}
\begin{steppanel}{algleave}
\slab{algleave}{47}{Uji rasio} Ketika \(y\) meningkat (dengan \(x=0\)), setiap variabel basis tetap nonnegatif hanya sampai rasionya:
\[
\begin{aligned}
s_1 = 9 - y   &\ge 0 \iff y \le 9/1  = 9,\\
s_2 = 16 - y  &\ge 0 \iff y \le 16/1 = 16,\\
s_3 = 14 - 2y &\ge 0 \iff y \le 14/2 = 7 \quad(\text{terkecil}).
\end{aligned}
\]
Rasio terkecil adalah \(7\), yang dicapai oleh \(s_3\), sehingga \(s_3\) \textbf{keluar}.
\end{steppanel}
\begin{steppanel}{algpivot}
\slab{algpivot}{114}{Pivot} Selesaikan baris \(s_3\) terhadap \(y\): \(y = 7 - 0.5x - 0.5s_3\). Menyubstitusikannya ke fungsi objektif dan baris-baris lain memberikan
\[
\begin{aligned}
\max\quad & z = 21 + 0.5x - 1.5s_3 \\
\st\quad  & s_1 = 2 - 0.5x + 0.5s_3 \\
          & s_2 = 9 - 1.5x + 0.5s_3 \\
          & y = 7 - 0.5x - 0.5s_3
\end{aligned}
\]
\end{steppanel}

source_text:
\noindent\textbf{Iteration 2.}
\begin{steppanel}{algenter}
\slab{algenter}{43}{Entering} Only \(x\) has a positive objective coefficient (\(0.5\)), so \(x\) \textbf{enters}.
\end{steppanel}
\begin{steppanel}{algleave}
\slab{algleave}{47}{Ratio test} As \(x\) increases (with \(s_3=0\)):
\[
\begin{aligned}
s_1 = 2 - 0.5x &\ge 0 \iff x \le 2/0.5 = 4 \quad(\text{smallest}),\\
s_2 = 9 - 1.5x &\ge 0 \iff x \le 9/1.5 = 6,\\
y   = 7 - 0.5x &\ge 0 \iff x \le 7/0.5 = 14.
\end{aligned}
\]
The smallest ratio is \(4\), attained by \(s_1\), so \(s_1\) \textbf{leaves}.
\end{steppanel}
\begin{steppanel}{algpivot}
\slab{algpivot}{114}{Pivot} Solve the \(s_1\) row for \(x\): \(x = 4 - 2s_1 + s_3\). Substituting gives
\[
\begin{aligned}
\max\quad & z = 23 - s_1 - s_3 \\
\st\quad  & x = 4 - 2s_1 + s_3 \\
          & s_2 = 3 + 3s_1 - s_3 \\
          & y = 5 + s_1 - s_3
\end{aligned}
\]
\end{steppanel}
\begin{steppanel}{algopt}
\slab{algopt}{52}{Optimal} Every nonbasic objective coefficient is \(\le 0\), so no further improvement is possible: \(x=4,\ y=5,\ z=23\).
\end{steppanel}
%
%

target_text:
\noindent\textbf{Iterasi 2.}
\begin{steppanel}{algenter}
\slab{algenter}{43}{Masuk} Hanya \(x\) yang memiliki koefisien objektif positif (\(0.5\)), sehingga \(x\) \textbf{masuk}.
\end{steppanel}
\begin{steppanel}{algleave}
\slab{algleave}{47}{Uji rasio} Ketika \(x\) meningkat (dengan \(s_3=0\)):
\[
\begin{aligned}
s_1 = 2 - 0.5x &\ge 0 \iff x \le 2/0.5 = 4 \quad(\text{terkecil}),\\
s_2 = 9 - 1.5x &\ge 0 \iff x \le 9/1.5 = 6,\\
y   = 7 - 0.5x &\ge 0 \iff x \le 7/0.5 = 14.
\end{aligned}
\]
Rasio terkecil adalah \(4\), yang dicapai oleh \(s_1\), sehingga \(s_1\) \textbf{keluar}.
\end{steppanel}
\begin{steppanel}{algpivot}
\slab{algpivot}{114}{Pivot} Selesaikan baris \(s_1\) terhadap \(x\): \(x = 4 - 2s_1 + s_3\). Substitusi memberikan
\[
\begin{aligned}
\max\quad & z = 23 - s_1 - s_3 \\
\st\quad  & x = 4 - 2s_1 + s_3 \\
          & s_2 = 3 + 3s_1 - s_3 \\
          & y = 5 + s_1 - s_3
\end{aligned}
\]
\end{steppanel}
\begin{steppanel}{algopt}
\slab{algopt}{52}{Optimal} Setiap koefisien objektif nonbasis bernilai \(\le 0\), sehingga tidak ada perbaikan lebih lanjut yang mungkin: \(x=4,\ y=5,\ z=23\).
\end{steppanel}
%
%

