source_text:
\begin{ex}{Reading a tableau}{}
\label{ex:tableau-reading}
\stars{1} The following tableau arose while solving a maximization problem, with the objective row on top:
\begin{center}
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{c|ZZZZ|Z}
\toprule
Basis & $x_1$ & $x_2$ & $s_1$ & $s_2$ & RHS\\
\midrule
$z$   & $0$ & $0$ & $3$ & $1$ & $40$\\
\midrule
$x_1$ & $1$ & $0$ & $2$  & $-1$ & $6$\\
$x_2$ & $0$ & $1$ & $-1$ & $1$  & $4$\\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
\end{center}
Identify the basic and nonbasic variables, state the corresponding basic feasible solution and its objective value, and explain how you can tell from the objective row that this tableau is optimal.
\exrefs{\S\ref{sec:tableau-building}; \S\ref{sec:tableau-optimality}}
\end{ex}

target_text:
\begin{ex}{Membaca tableau}{}
\label{ex:tableau-reading}
\stars{1} Tableau berikut muncul saat menyelesaikan masalah maksimisasi, dengan
baris objektif di bagian atas:
\begin{center}
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{c|ZZZZ|Z}
\toprule
Basis & $x_1$ & $x_2$ & $s_1$ & $s_2$ & RHS\\
\midrule
$z$   & $0$ & $0$ & $3$ & $1$ & $40$\\
\midrule
$x_1$ & $1$ & $0$ & $2$  & $-1$ & $6$\\
$x_2$ & $0$ & $1$ & $-1$ & $1$  & $4$\\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
\end{center}
Identifikasi variabel basis dan nonbasis, nyatakan solusi basis layak yang
bersesuaian beserta nilai objektifnya, dan jelaskan bagaimana baris objektif
menunjukkan bahwa tableau ini optimal.
\exrefs{\S\ref{sec:tableau-building}; \S\ref{sec:tableau-optimality}}
\end{ex}

