\max \quad & 3x_1 + 2x_2 \\
\text{dengan kendala} \quad & x_1 + x_2 \leq 4 \\
& 2x_1 + x_2 \leq 6 \\
& x_1, x_2 \geq 0
\end{aligned}
\]
